            "initialRows": "100|0.50|0.00|250|0.29|0.42|yes\n250|0.75|0.00|250|0.46|0.59|yes\n500|1.00|0.00|250|0.64|0.78|yes\n1000|1.00|0.00|250|0.64|0.78|yes\n2000|0.50|0.00|250|0.29|0.42|no\n||||||\n||||||",
